DreamExpandableArea:ExpansionAlpha {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:ExpansionAlpha
    src   "Where a running open or close currently stands, 0 collapsed to 1 expanded. Kept at the flag's end\nwhile nothing travels, so an open starts from where the section actually is."
    text  "正在进行的展开或折叠当前所处的位置，0为折叠，1为展开。没有动画进行时保持在标志的一端，\n因此展开会从区段实际所在的位置开始。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:ExpansionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:ExpansionDuration
    src   "How long the open and close take, in seconds. Zero (the default) is instant.\n\nInstant by DEFAULT and not by preference: every expander already authored against this plugin\nopens instantly, the suite asserts the control's height in the same breath as the flag, and a\nsilently animated open would make both of those wrong. Opting in is one number.\n\nA click while a travel is under way turns it round from where it has got: the section goes back\nthe way it came, from the height it shows, and takes as long as it has travelled. This departs\nfrom UMG on purpose. SExpandableArea::SetExpanded_Animated starts a new curve from one of its\nends -- an open from collapsed, a close from fully open -- so a section caught halfway jumps to\nthat end before it moves; turning round from the height it shows never jumps."
    text  "展开和折叠所需的时间，单位为秒。零（默认值）表示瞬时。\n\n默认即时而非出于偏好：所有已经针对此插件编写的展开器都是即时展开的，\n测试套件会在断言标志的同时断言控件的高度，而\n一个悄悄带动画的展开会让这两者都出错。启用它只需一个数字。\n\n动画进行中点击会从当前位置折返：区段会沿着来时的方向回去，\n从它显示的高度出发，所用的时间与它已经走过的时间一样长。这是有意\n与UMG不同的。SExpandableArea::SetExpanded_Animated会从它的某一端开始一条新曲线\n——展开从折叠开始，折叠从完全展开开始——因此一个处在半途的区段会在移动之前跳到\n那一端；而从它显示的高度折返则永远不会跳变。"
    state machine
}

