DreamExpandableArea:MaxHeight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:MaxHeight
    src   "A ceiling on the CONTENT's share of the control's height, in local units -- UMG's MaxHeight.\n\nZero (the default) is no ceiling, which is what this control has always done: expanded, it is\nas tall as its header plus whatever is inside it. A non-zero value caps that and clips the\ncolumn to it, which is the only honest way to put a section of unknown length inside a page\nthat has a length."
    text  "内容在控件高度中所占份额的上限，以本地单位计——即UMG的MaxHeight。\n\n零（默认值）表示不设上限，这也是该控件一直以来的行为：展开时，其高度\n等于标题加上其中的内容。非零值会限制该高度并将列裁剪到该值，\n这是在具有长度的页面中放置长度未知的区块时\n唯一诚实可行的做法。"
    state machine
}

