DreamExpandableArea:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的\n名称合成其反向路由，因此值控件会连同它一起携带自身事件。与它们一同触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetContent
    src   "Put InContent in the content column, taking it from wherever it currently hangs.\n\nThe code-facing half of the nesting idiom in the class comment: a hierarchy built by hand has\nno .dui author to nest anything, so it says where the content goes. Null empties the column."
    text  "将InContent放入内容列，并从它当前挂载的位置移走。\n\n这是类注释中嵌套惯例面向代码的那一半：手工构建的层级没有.dui作者来嵌套任何内容，\n因此由它指明内容的去向。为Null时清空该列。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetExpansionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetExpansionDuration
    src   "How long the NEXT open or close takes. Nothing is re-run: a duration describes a move that has\nnot happened yet, and replaying the current one to honour a new speed would animate a section\nthe player already finished opening."
    text  "下一次打开或关闭所花费的时间。不会重新执行任何内容：时长描述的是尚未发生的动作，\n为了遵从新的速度而重放当前动作，会让玩家已经完成展开的区块\n再次播放动画。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetIsExpanded {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetIsExpanded
    src   "Silent when the flag does not move; otherwise pushes the visuals and broadcasts both events.\n\nCollapsing first moves every player's focus that is inside the content onto the header (through\nFDreamFocusReturn::MoveFocusOutOf), so the next stick press starts from the section that closed\nrather than from nowhere."
    text  "标志未变化时保持静默；否则推送视觉效果并广播这两个事件。\n\n折叠时会先把内容内所有玩家的焦点移到标题上（通过\nFDreamFocusReturn::MoveFocusOutOf），使下一次摇杆操作从刚刚关闭的区块开始，\n而不是从空处开始。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetLabel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetLabel
    src   "The words on the header, written through to the label the control owns.\n\nA setter rather than a bare property because the header's text is pushed by the style pass: a\nwrite without one left the control showing the previous words until something else pushed."
    text  "标题上的文字，会直接写入该控件所拥有的标签。\n\n这里用Setter而不是裸属性，是因为标题的文本由样式流程推送：只写入而不触发推送，会让控件\n一直显示之前的文字，直到有其他东西推送为止。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetMaxHeight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetMaxHeight
    src   "Re-measures at once: the ceiling is part of the height this control claims."
    text  "会立即重新测量：该上限是控件声明的高度的一部分。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:SetStyle
    src   "This instance's whole look, replaced and pushed. See UDreamButton::SetStyle for the caveat."
    text  "本实例的完整外观，整体替换并推送。注意事项参见 UDreamButton::SetStyle。"
    state machine
}

DreamExpandableArea:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamExpandableArea.h#DreamExpandableArea:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

